    "title": "Other Drug Makers Will Likely Follow Pfizer in Signing Deals With Trump Administration to Lower Prices: Jeffrey Tucker",
    "text": "President Donald Trump on Sept. 30 announced a deal with Pfizer that featured the pharmaceutical manufacturer agreeing to offer some of its drugs to consumers at reduced prices. NTD discussed this with Jeffrey Tucker, founder and president of the Brownstone Institute. He's also the author of the book \"Life After Lockdown.\"\nOther Drug Makers Will Likely Follow Pfizer in Signing Deals With Trump Administration to Lower Prices: Jeffrey Tucker\nJeffrey Tucker, president of the Brownstone Institute, discussed Pfizer agreeing to lower prices for some of the drugs it sells to consumers.\nBy\n|\nPublished: 10/1/2025, 11:08:08 PM EDT",
